# .github/CODEOWNERS
#
# With "Require review from Code Owners" on, GitHub blocks merge until an
# owner of every changed file approves. Later lines win.
# Keep the high-risk entries in sync with paths.high-risk in risk-tiers.yml.
#
# Sole maintainer: GitHub refuses self-approval, so the protect-main ruleset
# (G7) gives repository admins a bypass in pull_request mode. Merges still
# go through a PR. A second human reviewer replaces the bypass later.

# Default
*                   @andrimuhayat

# High-risk paths
/src/auth/          @andrimuhayat
/src/payments/      @andrimuhayat
/src/claims/        @andrimuhayat
**/pii/             @andrimuhayat
/db/migrations/     @andrimuhayat
/api/public/        @andrimuhayat
/openapi*.yaml      @andrimuhayat
/openapi*.yml       @andrimuhayat
/infra/             @andrimuhayat
/terraform/         @andrimuhayat

# Agent and pipeline control files
/risk-tiers.yml     @andrimuhayat
/.mcp.json          @andrimuhayat
/AGENTS.md          @andrimuhayat
/CLAUDE.md          @andrimuhayat
/.claude/           @andrimuhayat
/.github/           @andrimuhayat
/.githooks/         @andrimuhayat
